+ * The same function as CDC-NCM (boot-arg sweetusbncm=1): Windows has a
+ * native NCM host driver (UsbNcm) but none for ECM. Own PID so the host does
+ * not reuse what it cached for the ECM descriptors. Frames travel in 16-bit
+ * NTBs; the host is asked for one datagram per NTB (wNtbOutMaxDatagrams 1).
+ */
